	$$renderer.push(`<h1>Theming</h1> <p class="lead svelte-1xfzdbj">Create beautiful, branded command palettes with full theming support.
	Switch between themes dynamically based on user preference.</p> <h2>Theme Object Pattern</h2> <p>The recommended approach is to create theme objects and spread them:</p> <div class="code-block"><div class="code-block-header"><div class="dots"><span class="dot"></span> <span class="dot"></span> <span class="dot"></span></div> <span>Theme Object Pattern</span></div> <pre><code>&lt;script lang="ts">
