/></code></pre></div> <h2>Theme Presets</h2> <p>Here are some ready-to-use theme inspirations:</p> <h3>Linear-Inspired Theme</h3> <div class="code-block"><div class="code-block-header"><div class="dots"><span class="dot"></span> <span class="dot"></span> <span class="dot"></span></div> <span>Linear Theme</span></div> <pre><code>// Linear-inspired theme
