}</code></pre></div> <h2>Tailwind Integration</h2> <p>Use Tailwind classes directly for rapid theming:</p> <div class="code-block"><div class="code-block-header"><div class="dots"><span class="dot"></span> <span class="dot"></span> <span class="dot"></span></div> <span>Tailwind Classes</span></div> <pre><code>&lt;CommandPalette
